---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "Chiến dịch TikTok - UI design | Thuy An Portfolio";
const description = "“I worked on these projects when I was freelancing, collaborating with a close friend. My friend took care of the sketching and working with clients, while I handled the coloring and UI design based on the wireframes provided by TikTok VietNam.”";
const ogImage = "/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/thumb.webp";
---
<BaseLayout lang="vi" page="tiktok-camp" title={title} description={description} ogImage={ogImage} divider={true}>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-[140px] pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">Chiến dịch TikTok - UI design</h1>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty break-words max-w-[900px]">“Đây là những dự án mình làm khi còn freelance, hợp tác cùng một người bạn thân.<br>Bạn mình phụ trách phác thảo và làm việc với khách hàng, còn mình phụ trách lên màu và thiết kế UI dựa trên wireframe do TikTok Việt Nam cung cấp.”</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium">Hạng mục : Thiết kế LP chiến dịch<br>Khách hàng : Tiktok VietNam<br>Công cụ : Adobe Illustrator</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-ink/15" aria-label="Campaign 01">
        <h2 class="text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium">01. Chiến dịch hashtag:<br>#Learn On Tiktok 2021 - 2022</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-[50px] items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[490px] mx-auto"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/01.webp" alt="Screen 1" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-[6px]" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-[490px] mx-auto"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/03.webp" alt="Screen 3" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-[6px]" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-[490px] mx-auto"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/04.webp" alt="Screen 4" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-[6px]" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-ink/15" aria-label="Campaign 02">
        <h2 class="text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium">02. Chiến dịch hashtag:<br>#HocCungTikTok 2022</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-[50px] items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[490px] mx-auto"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/05.webp" alt="Screen 5" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-[6px]" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-[490px] mx-auto"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tiktok-camp/06.webp" alt="Screen 6" width="2400" height="1768" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-[6px]" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-ink/15" aria-label="Campaign 03">
        <h2 class="text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium">03. Chiến dịch hashtag:<br>#DaiHocCoGiVui 2022</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-[50px] items-start">
