      </section>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-ink/15" aria-label="Campaign 06">
        <h2 class="text-[16px] leading-6 font-medium">06. Chiến dịch hashtag:<br>#TuanLeBaoChi 2022</h2>
